 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nTalleres Mediterráneo SA                     MASTER SERVICES\nAvenida Diagonal 220, 46001 Valencia, Spain               AGREEMENT\nCIF/NIF: ESB37147539\n\nFROM                                                   FACTURAR A\n\nTalleres Mediterráneo SA                               Distribuciones Ibérica SL\nAvenida Diagonal 220                                   Avenida Diagonal 220\n46001 Valencia                                         46001 Valencia\nSpain                                                  Spain\nVAT: ESB37147539\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 10/02/2026 (the \"Effective\nDate\") by and between Talleres Mediterráneo SA, with its registered office at Avenida Diagonal 220,\nValencia (\"Party A\"), and Distribuciones Ibérica SL, with its registered office at Avenida Diagonal\n220, Valencia (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 36 months from the Effective Date unless\nterminated earlier in accordance with Section 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall\nuse it solely for the purposes of this Agreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\n Party A   Talleres Mediterráneo SA / Carlos García\n Party B   Distribuciones Ibérica SL / Carlos García\n Date      10/02/2026",
